    <!-- Disables Fast Deployment, which pushes assemblies to a .__override__ directory
         instead of packaging them in the APK. Fast Deployment is deprecated and is a known
         problem source on modern Android, and the Server head already sets this in BOTH
         configurations while this head set it only in Debug. Matching them removes a real
         inconsistency between the two heads.
         NOT the cause of the startup hang seen on 2026-07-27, despite what an earlier version
         of this comment claimed. That was a missing NEARBY_WIFI_DEVICES permission: the app
         ran fine and every WiFi Direct call threw SecurityException, so the UI never advanced
         past the logo. Kept because the inconsistency is worth removing on its own. -->
    <EmbedAssembliesIntoApk>true</EmbedAssembliesIntoApk>
